      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `CanonicalWebUrlProvider.java` will always returns a value that ends with “/”. And HttpServletRequest#getServletPath() almost always starts with “/”.\nSo with the default configuration:\n```\nbaseUrl \u003d canonicalWebUrl \u003d https://gerrit.example.com/\nservletPath\u003d /a/changes/12345\nresulting redirect \u003d https://gerrit.example.com//a/changes/12345   ← double “/”\n```",
      "parentUuid": "73a1d2c9_84ba5007",
